								<div class="sub-content">
									<p style="text-align: justify; "><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';">The Pyongyang National Musical Instrument Factory is a comprehensive and modernized production base for national musical instrument which has been newly built under the benevolence of the Party.</span><br></p>									<p style="text-align: justify; "><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';">The factory produces traditional musical instrument of Korean nation incl. fife, mean fife, treble fife, tanso, treble tanso, jangsaenap, saenap, bamboo flute, bass flute, whole tone- tanso, whole tone fife, Okryugum, Yanggum, Kayagum, small Oungum, Medium Oungum, Sohaegum, Junghaegum, Taehaegum, Johaegum, Janggo for performance, Janggo for dancing, big drum, medium drum, hand drum, drum for dancing, gong, tam-tam, bow for musical instrument, etc.</span></p><p style="text-align: justify; "><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';">Majorin¬g in production of handmade article, the factory has established perfect production lines and put CNC on the main equipment at the high level, thus it ensures high quality of the products with low-cost.&nbsp;</span></p>								</div>
